  "description": "JsonIX is a powerful, lightweight, and fast JSON-based database engine for .NET applications. It simplifies data persistence by providing high-level abstractions for CRUD operations, hierarchical data structures, and advanced object-to-document mapping using Reflection. Whether you need a simple key-value store or a complex nested data repository, JsonIX provides the tools to manage your local data with minimal code and maximum performance.",
