  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes (v1.0.0):\n-Core Engine: High-performance persistence layer for basic key-value data management.\n-Append Module: Optimized logic for handling and updating dynamic lists and collections.\n-HSet Architecture: Structured field-based storage to manage complex and nested data categories.\n-Data Integrity: Built-in error handling and safe file I/O operations to prevent data corruption.\n-Optimized Serialization: Pre-configured JSON settings including CamelCase naming policy and cycle handling for better compatibility.\n-Lightweight Core: Zero external dependencies, ensuring a small footprint for your projects.",
